,0:01:59.37,0:02:01.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hi ga noboriComment: 0,0:02:01.86,0:02:06.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kanashimi sae hitoshiku terasuComment: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.21,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,ShinjiterundaComment: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:15.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Itsuka hitotsu ni tsunagaru mirai woComment: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:19.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Issho ni mitsuke ni ikouComment: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:23.51,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi no kawari wa inaiComment: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:25.35,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WasurenaideComment: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:27.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We fight togetherComment: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:22.01,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Setting out before the day breaksComment: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:26.52,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,To greet an unknown tomorrowComment: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:30.10,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We have no regrets in our resolveComment: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:33.19,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,(Oh, I know what I’m supposed to do)Comment: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:36.86,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,No matter what kind of trials lie ahead,Comment: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:41.46,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nothing can stop my throbbing heartComment: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:46.16,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is only one place to goComment: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.07,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,(Fly to the light)Comment: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:51.79,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Bonds forged through battleComment: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:55.50,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I won’t let anyone get hurtComment: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:58.30,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,When I open my clenched fist,Comment: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.55,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I will find power thereComment: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.93,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let’s startComment: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:09.10,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The new world is callingComment: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.48,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,See now lookComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:17.86,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,No matter how many seas separate usComment: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:21.61,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I’ve always got your backComment: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:25.28,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Don’t be afraid to advanceComment: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.65,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Don’t forgetComment: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.04,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We fight togetherComment: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:36.96,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I’ve never spoiled the memoryComment: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.67,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Of the vast infinite sky,Comment: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:44.80,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That I gazed upon that dayComment: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:48.27,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We’ve come a long wayComment: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:52.17,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Each with our own pledges in our heartsComment: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:54.77,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is no doubtComment: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:59.23,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,There are burdens we must bearComment: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:01.74,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The sun will riseComment: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:06.66,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,And even illuminate our sorrowsComment: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:09.08,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, I believe it!Comment: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:15.50,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,One Piece will someday bind us togetherComment: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:19.09,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let’s go and find it!Comment: 0,0:02:18.84,0:02:22.88,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,You’re irreplaceableComment: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.05,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Don’t forgetComment: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.43,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We fight togetherDialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's era is over.Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:41.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line, near the Sabaody ArchipelagoDialogue: 1,0:02:35.37,0:02:41.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line, near the Sabaody ArchipelagoDialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:41.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Pirates all over the world act with burning ambition.Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:45.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Trafalgar Law is...Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What? We're still not going?Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just go to the New World already!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you, we're waiting for the right time.Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:58.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar LawDialogue: 1,0:02:53.32,0:02:58.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar LawDialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't rush things.Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The great treasure, One Piece, isn't going anywhere.Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.89,0:03:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But you know, Blackbeard and his group are causing a stir in the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that they've already crushed one pirate crew!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,And there are bunches of rookies with bounties over a hundred million entering the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:17.91,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If we dawdle around back here, we're gonna fall behind, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Those guys can go on eliminating each other.Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't participate in pointless fights.Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit whining and just follow my orders.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:32.86,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a throne waiting for us, never doubt it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.39,0:03:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We will follow you wherever you go!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:42.57,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Winter Island, the New WorldDialogue: 1,0:03:38.96,0:03:42.57,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Winter Island, the New WorldDialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],This is the favorite base of Kaido, one of the Four Emperors.Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been entrusted with guarding it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,And? What do you want me to do?Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,X Drake Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,X DrakeDialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you to do anything. It's just a warning.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:01.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You're better off not angering Kaido, rookie.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, if I take your head then Kaido will take action?Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed. If you understand, then quit stalling and just-Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That makes things much easier!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:18.17,Main,,0,0,0,,An ancient zoan type, huh? Now that's rare!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Scratch!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:31.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Spring Island, the New WorldDialogue: 1,0:04:27.28,0:04:31.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Spring Island, the New WorldDialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,There's still so many of them?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Scratchmen ApooDialogue: 1,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Scratchmen ApooDialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:42.39,Main,,0,0,0,,This is serious.Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch.Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Don't worry, guys! We've got Captain Apoo on our side! Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get the hell out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:54.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:05:00.03,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There's no way we can beat a whole army of these ferocious boars!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:05.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! We're headed straight for a cliff!Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:07.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, we have to escape somehow!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:10.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We're done for!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:11.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's the ocean right beneath that cliff!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care! Jump!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huuuuuh?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:19.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! I don't know if you noticed, but we're running on air!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The boars are following us into the air too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with this island?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so hot...Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,My legs are totally exhausted...Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:41.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,San Juan WolfDialogue: 1,0:05:36.78,0:05:41.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,San Juan WolfDialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no strength in my body either...Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch. A fish just bit me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:52.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,On a certain Burning Island in the New WorldDialogue: 1,0:05:46.02,0:05:52.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,On a certain Burning Island in the New WorldDialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit fussing, Wolf.Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:52.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Because of you, our raft almost broke.Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:54.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why we're doing this.Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:06:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Trying to sail the seas of the New World on that raft was an absurd idea anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If I knew it'd be like this, we would've stolen a warship at Marineford.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:05.98,Captions,,0,0,0,,Marshall D. TeachDialogue: 1,0:06:00.81,0:06:05.98,Captions,,0,0,0,,Marshall D. TeachDialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all attached to that old raft though.Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:09.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Jesus BurgessDialogue: 1,0:06:06.11,0:06:09.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Jesus BurgessDialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that you are too careless! In everything you do.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:14.15,Captions,,0,0,0,,ShiryuDialogue: 1,0:06:09.78,0:06:14.15,Captions,,0,0,0,,ShiryuDialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Put me in command! I'll take over as captain for you, Teach.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:18.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,Avalo PizarroDialogue: 1,0:06:14.29,0:06:18.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,Avalo PizarroDialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you. We are the Blackbeard Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:24.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,LafitteDialogue: 1,0:06:19.12,0:06:24.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,LafitteDialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:28.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Heaven already knows the fate of all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:29.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Doc Q Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.40,0:06:29.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Doc QDialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],We're almost out of booze. Can't we go to an island with a city on it soon?Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:36.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Vasco ShotDialogue: 1,0:06:30.07,0:06:36.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Vasco ShotDialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:42.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I agree. Though rather than a ship, I'd like some nice clothes.Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:42.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,Catarina DevonDialogue: 1,0:06:36.81,0:06:42.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,Catarina DevonDialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of these prison outfits!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go take a look.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Van OgreDialogue: 1,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Van OgreDialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.75,Main,,0,0,0,,They're taking too long.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],You can say that again. These guys look like they're going numb.Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right,Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Jewelry Bonney? Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:03.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Jewelry BonneyDialogue: 1,0:06:58.13,0:07:03.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Jewelry BonneyDialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Bonney...Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I'm impressed that a girl like you managed to get a bounty over one hundred million!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],The New World is reserved for the chosen strong ones!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You did well making it this far from South Blue,Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,but this is the end for you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you join my crew since you're so weak,Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],but how about this? If you become my woman, I'll gladly take you along.Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:38.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll get to sail the seas ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Get bent, you bearded swine!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been rejected.Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget it! You're way too vulgar!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Women are supposed to be dignified, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got more than enough vulgar guys in my crew!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you tell her!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,As planned, we'll hand her over to the Navy,Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:05.73,Main,,0,0,0,,in exchange for a proper warship!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:07.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain.Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:11.89,Main,,0,0,0,,They've got the warship they promised us, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],They do have a ship, but I doubt they're gonna give it to us.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? How can you tell?Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Akainu is onboard.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:24.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! I'd rather avoid that guy for now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get the hell out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,A complete failure!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Blackbeard?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gone!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,When I heard you'd fled from the government,Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,my blood ran cold.Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:46.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's all over for you now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you for this!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sacred Mary Geoise, the Red LineDialogue: 1,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sacred Mary Geoise, the Red LineDialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.65,Main,,0,0,0,,He vanished?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's honestly what happened.Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Who put you up to this? Sengoku?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Nah...Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone above him.Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],It's not a figure of speech either. He really just vanished on the spot.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It surprised me. I had no idea that the Shadow Shadow Fruit could do that.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is nothing to laugh at!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine. He was on the verge of death.Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever he tried to do, it would be too late.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:36.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless of course he went and zombified himself, that is!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That would suit him, though.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:41.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so carefree about this?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit being so cocky.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,When, exactly, did you become my boss?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how much authority you guys hold in the government, I'm a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So I don't care!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:10:03.18,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If this deal with you guys ever stops being fun, I'll quit being a warlord immediately.Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind.Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,, Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:14.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,Birdie Kingdom, the South BlueDialogue: 1,0:10:10.22,0:10:14.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,Birdie Kingdom, the South BlueDialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:15.05,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],M-Mister Racoon Dog. We say you could come back anytime, Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:17.16,Main,,0,0,0,,but this too soon, right?Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:19.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you've got the wrong man!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I may look like him, but I'm actually his friend, Chopper Mask!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You trying too hard, Mister Racoon Dog.Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You put on disguise because you embarrassed you come back so soon?Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I keep telling you you're wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:38.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You alright, Mister Racoon Dog?Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, stop be mean to him.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,These situations, we just play along.Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right! Your kindness is just too painful!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:49.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mister Racoon Dog!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That tickles, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Actually, there's something I have to do here. Can I stay a little longer?Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! You always welcome.Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There are so many plants I've never seen before growing on that tree.Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let me research them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, we have perfect place.Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:30.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to get more stamina and power, too.Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:34.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mister Racoon Dog?Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:36.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You back already?Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I glad.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Everyone, I'll be staying on this island for a while, so let's get along!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, we here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This be...Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,the village library.Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want research, use this.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,There are so many books!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There's even more! It's filled with books all the way into the back!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! They're all books about the plants I want to research and the medicines I want to make!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,And there are so many of them!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There many plants to make strong medicine from on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],We have technology to make, but before birds prevent us getting ingredients, so we troubled.Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I'd judged the people of this island by their appearance,Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],but now that I think about it, their weapons are pretty high-tech.Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:47.40,Main,,0,0,0,,They looked like a primitive bunch but this country actually has really advanced science, doesn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.01,Main,,0,0,0,,There are many things to learn here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:54.81,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Mister Racoon Dog! You think you thinking that, but you saying it out loud!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It really rude, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:13:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much I can accomplish here?Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:04.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's the Abominable Snowman!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:05.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Kill it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:06.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:08.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take it down!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:14.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pirates are great! There are countless unbelievable people out at sea!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:17.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you should go out to sea someday, too!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:21.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you go out to sea, you'll realize just how insignificant your own troubles are!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:26.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Compared to the rest of the world, the island you were born on is as small as this!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:27.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:30.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No, smaller! This one country is as small as this!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's true!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:38.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't join a crew of humans!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:43.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't join your crew!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:44.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So I've just come to thank you...Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:52.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm... grateful to you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Thank you... for inviting me...Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here, but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you ever feel like it...Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,then feel free to come visit us-Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:04.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's go!!!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:22.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy brought me out to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I've been desperately trying to keep up,Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but what did I ever do for Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:38.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I never want to experience anything like that again.Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,back then...Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Luffy must have been in even more pain than the rest of us!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you made me one of your crewmates,Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be alright. No matter what anyone says!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If it means I can be of any help to you...Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,then I'll even become a real monster!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.33,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:25.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:36.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,will definitely...Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Drag Kingdom on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:52.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, what was the deal with that newspaper?Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:53.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So that's what you meant?Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:56.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou suddenly calmed down after that.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:16:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I received a message that only Luffy's crewmates, like myself would understand.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Just from that article.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe that he and I are crewmates, then I won't tell you, you dumbass.Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're getting on vmy nerves!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, who made this food?Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.69,0:16:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Vi see that vyou can recognize good food when vyou taste it.Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The taste is good too, but more than that, my body feels strangely revitalized.Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed. This is the dish of aggression!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:32.34,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Many chefs on this island are capable of making this dish!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:32.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!.. Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:33.32,Main,,0,0,0,,.Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,..Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Behold the beautiful strong physiques of the candies on this island!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.11,Main,,0,0,0,,And their gentle hearts!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:48.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The candies grow like this from eating the dish of aggression!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Your diet decides your condition!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And your physique!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,And your personality!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,All things that make up the human body!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:17:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,If 100% of the humans in the world were to drink milk every day,Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],crime would disappear from the world! Can you believe it?Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi'm saying that...Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,if you're not aggressive, you lose!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Using food to build one's physique...Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:18.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never thought of it that way before.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,So, every day, my cooking could help them develop?Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And then...Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I could make Nami-san and Robin-chan's bodies become even sexier?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What should vwe do with this guy?Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What would I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:39.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm all fired up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:41.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to make that dish of aggression!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:44.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The answer is no!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,These 99 vital recipes have been passed down through the Kamabakka Drag Kingdom,Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,as one of the Secret Techniques of Newkama Kenpo: Bride Training!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:18:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell Vi would let some random nobody like vyou learn them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,If vyou want to know, then make vyour heart that of a maiden!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:07.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Study Newkama Kenpo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:15.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I was not born to be friends with the ladies!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I am a man who was born...Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,to love the ladies!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:31.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou make a solid argument.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi like that! Vi will give you a chance.Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.26,Main,,0,0,0,,A chance?Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi will give the recipes to the 99 grandmasters of Newkama Kenpo that reside on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If vyou are a pirate, then steal all of those recipes!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:58.75,Main,,0,0,0,,However, vwe will be prepared, and all the newkamas will attempt to put you in the sweets dress!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:02.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi'm curious to see if vyou can hold on to vyour manliness.Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Sanji-kyun !Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you rest!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The sweets dress.Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I will make you remember the joy of wearing a skirt!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Being a maiden is great, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou...Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:25.58,Main,,0,0,0,,versus the Newkama Head Temple!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If vyou can win this battle, Vi will even give you a ship.Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi will grant all vyour requests.Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, what will you do?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, cook!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:41.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Join my crew, will ya?Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Become the cook on my pirate ship!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Should Vi take the fact that vyou're not responding as an indication that vyou give up?Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Understandable. If vyou lose-Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I've won...Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I've beaten you all...Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:20:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have gotten several times stronger than I am now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:04.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even if you pierce his body with hundreds of weapons,Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:10.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,nobody stands a chance against a spear of pure guts.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:12.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't you lose.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:19.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of going someday too.Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,To the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.57,0:20:23.33,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Then let's go now!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:25.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's not time yet.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:30.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know of All Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:31.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Nope!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:33.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What, you don't know?Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:35.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's a miraculous sea!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:40.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We've both got stupid dreams.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:47.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,In order to reach my own goal, the All Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:52.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I'll tag along on your road to becoming the pirate king.Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be your ship's cook.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:04.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the next time we meet...Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:05.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I will...Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:13.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,support you as the greatest cook in the world, so that you may become the pirate king.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:16.39,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I will...Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,live through...Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:22.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,this hell.Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I accept...Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,your challenge!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Well said.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Vwe will not hold back!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I will definitely...Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,win!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:52.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is Weatheria, a small sky island.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The research material she stole!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,And the weather ball!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And Mister Haredas!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Don't think we'll forgive you just because you gave them back!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I really regret my actions.Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:05.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think we'll trust you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's strip her of everything she has and kick her out of the country!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, to prove my regret,Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:14.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go throw myself into the ocean.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.71,0:22:15.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive me in my next life!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We made her cry!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be so harsh!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't just throw your life away, you're so young!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell...Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright. I forgive you.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:39.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be staying here for a while, studying your weather science.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.91,0:22:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Oh, my name is Nami. Call me Nami-san if you like.Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, I'd like a house of my own. Privacy is important, you know.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],One with a fluffy bed, a bathtub with bubbles, and a large closet.Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, oldtimers of the sky.Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do our best!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.45,0:23:00.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Mister Haredas, say something!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:02.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Good grief. Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:10.81,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Weatheria drifts over the world according to the whims of the wind.Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.81,0:23:17.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We occasionally go down to the surface to gather goods and information, and continue on our journey.Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:17.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Information?Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, records mostly.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.01,0:23:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Records on the unbelievable weather phenomena of the Grand Line. There are still so many-Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you listening to me?Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:34.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me? Raining lightning?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed. It literally rains lightning.Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.03,0:23:40.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The lightning comes down like rain.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It happens on an island in the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If you plan to cross that sea, you should know that it defies common sense more than anything before it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:54.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Please... Teach me, Haredas-san,Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:23:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,about the climate of the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything you know!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are hasty.Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Well, of course I am! My crewmates' lives all depend on me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm their navigator!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],When we're out at sea, I have the biggest responsibility of all of us!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I have to be ready to take us anywhere our captain wants to go, wherever it may be!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.81,0:24:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy says he's gonna be the pirate king,Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,so I can't take my job as a navigator lightly!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.58,0:24:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Your captain is a lucky man, to have a crew that's so devoted to him.Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.95,0:24:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a choice.Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't?Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.52,0:24:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I mean, he talks big all the time, but he's utterly clueless about the ocean.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:59.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He's always doing insane stuff, too.Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.55,0:25:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,If I left him alone...Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.34,0:25:04.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.12,0:25:07.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Help.Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.19,0:25:16.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You bet I will!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If I left him alone, he'd die.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.73,0:25:29.31,Main,,0,0,0,,He's such a moron, he's always causing me trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,He sounds like one troublesome captain!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:38.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm gonna help him.Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:41.85,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This time, I will!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.85,0:25:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me about the weather balls.Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:49.24,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Don't ask so casually, this is Weatheria's greatest invention you're talking about!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If they end up in the wrong hands, they could throw the entire world into disarray!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Could they be used as a weapon?Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.60,0:25:58.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey now, don't talk about such dangerous things!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:25:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't grin like that!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:18.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You are one of us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.66,0:26:47.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],This is Kenzan Island on the Grand Line, the Kingdom of Tehna Gehna.Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.55,0:26:47.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sword Mountain Island, the Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:26:42.55,0:26:47.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sword Mountain Island, the Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:26:42.55,0:26:47.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Longarm Kingdom Dialogue: 1,0:26:42.55,0:26:47.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Longarm Kingdom Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.52,0:26:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on in and have a look!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This creature has the appearance of a real skeleton!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],What's more, his arms only have a single joint! Is there a more extraordinary creature anywhere?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.50,0:27:07.84,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Hey! Don't try to deceive us with cheap tricks, charlatans!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:11.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Are you not satisfied?Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.02,0:27:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,That thing hasn't moved a muscle yet!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just a mannequin, isn't it?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.34,0:27:22.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san has made his decision.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:25.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,In which case, I must also do something.Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.45,0:27:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, skeleton! Quit messing with us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot just sit here!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.66,0:27:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you understand? That's right, move!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.10,0:27:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't be much of a show otherwise!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,How may I be of aid?Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Just moving around would be plenty helpful!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So move!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:58.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You were not the least bit scared when you saw me,Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.06,0:28:03.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and what's more, you invited me to join your crew.Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.33,0:28:06.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.10,0:28:08.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Join my crew!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.43,0:28:11.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh? Very well.Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:17.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It had been fifty years.Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.21,0:28:22.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Could you imagine my joy, after drifting around on the dark ocean for so long?Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:28.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A certain man stole my shadow.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.39,0:28:34.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],What're you talking about?! If you need a shadow, I'll get it back for you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.39,0:28:38.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how brilliantly you were shining to me?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.73,0:28:45.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Fifty years of praying for a miracle, answered at last.Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:47.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me back my money!Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.01,0:28:48.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Damn! I thought we'd make some money off this, but it looks hopeless.Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If he won't do as he's told, we'll just have to force-Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.92,0:29:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Forty degrees!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Argh, it's so difficult!Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.32,0:29:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's really talking and moving!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.92,0:29:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How creepy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.13,0:29:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that creature?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.73,0:29:17.73,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If I try going below forty-five degrees, I end up slipping.Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.73,0:29:20.64,Main,,0,0,0,,However, once I can master this...Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.68,0:29:25.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I may be of more use to Luffy-san.Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.78,0:29:29.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],On second thought, perhaps I should consider another method?Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He's holding a guitar!Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.75,0:29:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you planning now?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],You don't have to put on a crappy show! This is just an exhibition!Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.59,0:29:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,An exhibition is fine with me! Call it whatever you wish.Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.85,0:29:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The word "Loneliness" no longer exists in my vocabulary! Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.54,0:29:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it not boring to simply look at me?Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.69,0:30:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with this rhythm?Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It's making my heart dance!Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.95,0:30:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Please listen to my new single,Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,"Bone to be Wild!"Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:21.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the underside of the giant bridge in East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.96,0:30:21.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Giant Bridge, the East BlueDialogue: 1,0:30:16.96,0:30:21.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Giant Bridge, the East BlueDialogue: 0,0:30:22.14,0:30:25.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What brought about this change of attitude?Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.02,0:30:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,We are really grateful that you are coming with us to Baltigo.Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.05,0:30:33.86,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Dragon-san has always wanted to meet you.Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.35,0:30:39.81,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If I had known you were such charitable people, I would have wanted you to come and see me sooner.Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.81,0:30:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We're sorry! We hadn't heard about your team-up with Crocodile.Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.16,0:30:49.82,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],That was a joke. I was just teasing you. Sorry about that.Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:53.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad things turned out the way they did.Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Set sail! Set sail for Baltigo!Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.11,0:31:14.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Seventy-nine million belly?Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:16.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,An eight-year-old with a bounty that high?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.99,0:31:22.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],She's apparently a survivor from the demons of Ohara, who were plotting to destroy the world.Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.20,0:31:24.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,From Ohara?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:28.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And I have no idea how it happened, but she's supposed to have sunk six Navy warships as well.Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.94,0:31:30.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So that's why she got this insane bounty?Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.74,0:31:36.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],She is the child of demons, and she mustn't be allowed to live!Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:41.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Alright, you just wait right there!Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.47,0:31:44.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Why are you trying to save me?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.51,0:31:48.44,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],When did I ever ask you to do that?! Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:57.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I just want to die!Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.83,0:32:04.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:06.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are you guys out of your minds?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.54,0:32:10.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't think you'll be able to survive with the entire world as your enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.14,0:32:15.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.95,0:32:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Robin-san, please come inside.Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It's cold out here.Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine out here.Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.97,0:32:30.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate. You are revolutionaries.Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.59,0:32:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't trust you that easily.Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.60,0:32:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not enter a cabin where there are no escape-routes.Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.17,0:32:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! We have no intention of harming you!Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Just let me stay. Back when I was on my own, this was how I lived.Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... Very well.Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.65,0:32:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bring as many warm blankets as you can find!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And something hot to drink and eat, too!Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.10,0:32:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,B-But we've got all that prepared inside...Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.41,0:32:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! And a wind guard and a sofa, too!Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.35,0:32:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:03.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:08.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If I go to your father, and let the tides of the world direct me,Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:11.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can become a little stronger?Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.52,0:33:16.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wanting to become stronger for the sake of someone else.Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.70,0:33:19.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'd never considered it before.Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:27.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,We now move to Mech Island on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.85,0:33:31.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Futureland, BaldimoreDialogue: 0,0:33:31.50,0:33:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Investigating the sudden destruction of Doctor Vegapunk's laboratory.Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.20,0:33:39.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We still haven't been able to find the culprit.Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.16,0:33:48.41,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],It wouldn't be an exaggeration to call this the greatest loss of the century.Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.69,0:33:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about it?Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that an intruder resembling a gorilla entered the lab.Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.94,0:33:57.51,Main,,0,0,0,,It truly is baffling.Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.51,0:34:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to reach this island without an icebreaker ship.Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.91,0:34:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But nobody has seen any such ship.Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.72,0:34:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],They say that the intruder was Cyborg Franky of the Straw Hat Pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.10,0:34:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],but he was spotted less than a month ago on Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.17,0:34:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],We have no idea what route or means he used to get to Baldimore.Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Captain Gorilla! The search party is departing for the snow mountains!Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.00,0:34:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well. I shall go as well!Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.08,0:34:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:31.61,Main,,0,0,0,,A hidden entrance uncovered by the explosion.Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.61,0:34:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe it. We had no idea...Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.59,0:34:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,that there was a second laboratory in here.Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.89,0:34:47.78,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],This seems to be where he built the cyborg animals that guarded the place.Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.65,0:34:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't break anything!Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.97,0:34:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I want to hear that from!Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.50,0:35:00.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The laboratory that blew up contained inventions that made people's lives easier. Those are gone now.Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.74,0:35:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But the stuff I'm interested in are the blueprints for weapons and such. They are in this laboratory.Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.92,0:35:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There's stuff here on everything from battleships to human gene manipulation!Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.99,0:35:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What is going on inside this guy's head?Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.10,0:35:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, I've decided!Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.40,0:35:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I will live here!Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.70,0:35:25.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Live here?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.87,0:35:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Occasionally I'll come down from the mountain to stock up on cola,Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.74,0:35:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,so always keep some in your house, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Don't worry. As long as you stay quiet about me, I'll just live here.Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.28,0:35:43.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't cause any trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.92,0:35:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit making such a fuss over my face!Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.52,0:35:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look at us!Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Scary! Your face is scary!Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.16,0:35:52.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What about now? I put on a tiger carpet!Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.44,0:35:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's better.Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.58,0:35:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,F-F-Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.74,0:35:59.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing. Especially my legs.Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.85,0:36:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you wearing trousers?Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.93,0:36:15.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Would you please sail on the ship that I've built?Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.48,0:36:23.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy... You helped me carry out my dream.Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.89,0:36:26.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.33,0:36:31.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ship! It's the best!Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:33.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll take good care of it!Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.89,0:36:36.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you want me to return your speedo,Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:39.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,then join our crew!Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:46.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You brought me with you into this wide world.Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.18,0:36:54.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Passing through countless seas, overcoming innumerable battles and troubles.Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.32,0:36:58.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And once we've sailed to the end of the sea...Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.46,0:37:02.35,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,then my ship can truly be called the ship of my dreams.Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.17,0:37:10.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The Sunny still hasn't showed its full potential yet!Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.58,0:37:14.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],The only captain who can make the Sunny into my dream ship...Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.49,0:37:16.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,is you.Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.85,0:37:27.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I will learn technologies that will let it overcome adventures rougher than any we've had so far.Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.02,0:37:28.69,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.65,0:37:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey. The tiger skin is on fire.Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.84,0:37:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.64,0:37:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,A monster?! Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.10,0:38:00.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So Luffy, let's overcome them!Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:02.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The rough waves of the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.47,0:38:09.69,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This event passes into Grand Line history.Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.69,0:38:13.93,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Legend of the Burning Spirit Beast of Baldimore.Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:21.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the Bowin Archipelago on the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.61,0:38:23.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Bowin Islands, the Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:38:19.61,0:38:23.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Bowin Islands, the Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:26.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it now'n, Usopp'n? Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.97,0:38:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll burn some fat! And work out!Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.89,0:38:32.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh'n! That's a great idea'n!Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.23,0:38:33.76,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I'll become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.76,0:38:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Good'n! You can't get off the island otherwise'n!Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.31,0:38:39.91,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I'll become even stronger than that!Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.91,0:38:41.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes'n! That sounds good too'n!Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.78,0:38:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I'll become much, much stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.26,0:38:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That much'n?Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.60,0:38:49.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Much, much, much, much, much stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.98,0:38:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're incredibly motivated'n!Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.45,0:38:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Suddenly starting to work out like that'n.Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.93,0:38:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What exactly was written in that paper'n?Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.02,0:39:08.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I... received a message from our captain.Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.86,0:39:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Message?Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.60,0:39:13.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about? Get onboard, already.Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.47,0:39:19.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.55,0:39:32.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.80,0:39:36.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,U-Usopp...Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.16,0:39:38.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Y-You...Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.65,0:39:40.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,were here too?Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:45.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Win! And then we'll all go back together, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.43,0:39:47.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Of course we will!Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.22,0:39:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,thought that Luffy could become the pirate king on his own, I'd just stand by and watch.Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.81,0:40:03.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We've finally made it this far!Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.28,0:40:09.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When we've crossed the other half of the world, and see this wall again...Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.50,0:40:10.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When that happens...Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.82,0:40:13.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be the pirate king!Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:16.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Even he has plenty of enemies he can't beat.Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.83,0:40:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Luffy can be defeated!Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,He's pushing himself too hard! He was screaming!Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.60,0:40:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why...Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.10,0:40:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,he needs my strength!Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.01,0:40:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Heracles'n!Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.72,0:40:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.63,0:40:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Much, much, much stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.45,0:40:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Please, Heracles'n-sensei...Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.67,0:40:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sensei'n? Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.90,0:40:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been curious about those weapons of yours.Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to learn from you, the man who survives on this island using his amazing skills!Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.94,0:41:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Amazing skills'n? I am a sensei with amazing skills'n?Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.94,0:41:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! You are an amazingly skilled sensei!Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.81,0:41:05.89,Main,,0,0,0,,And,Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.89,0:41:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,my name is...Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Heracles'n!Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.45,0:41:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That's such a cool name!Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.30,0:41:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right! Take a seat, Usopp'n.Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.63,0:41:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sensei!Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.00,0:41:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, my student Usopp'n!Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:28.52,Main,,0,0,0,,There are plants on this island called pop green. They are hostile and can sprout instantly.Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.73,0:41:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,These are their seeds'n.Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.60,0:41:34.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Pop green?Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.97,0:41:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They all have their uses'n.Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.62,0:41:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I see'n.Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.21,0:41:43.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.60,0:41:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, Usopp'n! This forest will make you stronger'n!Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.82,0:41:53.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,In order to help you become the pirate king,Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.23,0:41:57.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I will become a true King of Snipers!Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:10.05,Narrator,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],And now, to Gloom Island on the Grand Line, ruins of Muggy Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.03,0:42:10.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,Muggy Kingdom RuinsDialogue: 1,0:42:05.03,0:42:10.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,Muggy Kingdom RuinsDialogue: 0,0:42:05.03,0:42:10.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gloom Island, Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:42:05.03,0:42:10.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gloom Island, Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:42:10.96,0:42:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.58,0:42:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, train me in the ways of the sword!Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.70,0:42:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I've misjudged you, Roronoa.Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You ask your sworn enemy to teach you?Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.71,0:42:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed!Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.86,0:42:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Get out of my sight. I have no business with such a worthless man.Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.07,0:42:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems I overestimated you.Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.51,0:42:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],What are you doing? You are only embarrassing yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.44,0:42:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You failed to defeat the baboons, and couldn't go out to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Then you crawled back here. I have nothing to teach one such as you.Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.79,0:42:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I did defeat the baboons.Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.82,0:43:02.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He beat them?Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.48,0:43:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I just need to take your head!Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.16,0:43:12.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm not so stupid to think I can beat you right now.Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.57,0:43:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I do not understand. If you still consider me your enemy,Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],why do you bow down before me and ask me to train you?Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.36,0:43:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,For what purpose?!Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.39,0:43:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,So that I can surpass you!Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:39.10,Main,,0,0,0,,So you want me to personally train a swordsman who wants take my own head?Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.10,0:43:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What a strange fellow. How ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,And you are still disgracing yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.07,0:43:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],It would seem I have found a man truly filled with ambition.Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.24,0:43:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, ghost-girl. Tend to his wounds.Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.04,0:43:59.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't tell me what to do!Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.42,0:44:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The training will begin after your wounds have healed.Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.50,0:44:07.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Everyone keeps ordering me around!Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.81,0:44:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, get back to your room!Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.32,0:44:13.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What an awkward man.Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.62,0:44:20.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,When someone like him discards his pride, it must be for the sake of another.Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.06,0:44:25.57,Main,,0,0,0,,"3D" with an X over it, and "2Y"?Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.57,0:44:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! It's tattooed into Straw Hat's right arm!Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.74,0:44:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],We made a promise to meet at a certain place in three days.Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.86,0:44:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,And now look at how it's turned out!Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.15,0:44:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,So "3D" stands for "Three days"?Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.88,0:44:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,But the "3D" is crossed out, and the "2Y" means...Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.14,0:44:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Two years.Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.00,0:44:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Two years?!Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],We won't be meeting up in three days, but in two years.Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.35,0:44:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Everything else was just a distraction to hide the real message from everyone else.Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.70,0:45:02.05,Main,,0,0,0,,This message was meant only for us. It's the decision that Luffy made.Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.70,0:45:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],There's no point in rushing. As we are, we won't stand a chance in the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.77,0:45:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll stop here, and increase our strength!Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.15,0:45:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,And then we'll set sail once more!Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.69,0:45:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,In two years at the Sabaody Archipelago!Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:22.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Few Days LaterDialogue: 1,0:45:19.63,0:45:22.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Few Days LaterDialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:22.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,In the Calm BeltDialogue: 1,0:45:19.63,0:45:22.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,In the Calm BeltDialogue: 0,0:45:27.90,0:45:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.14,0:45:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Thanks for everything!Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.85,0:45:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the one who ought to be thanking you!Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.72,0:45:51.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You listened to my plea and helped me escape from Impel Down,Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.66,0:45:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,allowing me to live on, though in a shameful manner.Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.63,0:45:57.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you enough.Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.03,0:46:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to stop that.Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.20,0:46:08.31,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If you hadn't been there, I might have never made it to Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.78,0:46:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Raise your head.Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.60,0:46:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.59,0:46:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And I might have the chance to help you again someday.Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.34,0:46:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],With that said, let us meet again in two years, at Fishman Island!Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.97,0:46:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I am looking forward to the day when you and your crew arrive!Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.77,0:46:38.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.78,0:46:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care!Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.62,0:46:52.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ruskaina, a Dessert IslandDialogue: 1,0:46:47.62,0:46:52.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ruskaina, a Dessert IslandDialogue: 0,0:46:47.62,0:46:52.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Northwest of the Isle of Women, Calm BeltDialogue: 1,0:46:47.62,0:46:52.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Northwest of the Isle of Women, Calm BeltDialogue: 0,0:46:53.32,0:46:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This island is ideal.Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.49,0:47:00.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's called the Island of 48 Seasons. It's a ruthless island where the season changes once a week.Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.33,0:47:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.20,0:47:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I will bring you food from the Isle of Women each and every day!Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.00,0:47:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What, seriously, Hancock?Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.64,0:47:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],In that case, I'd like that special dish of yours, the gorgon whatever-it-was!Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.16,0:47:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That was delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.21,0:47:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Of course...Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.75,0:47:25.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I will provide you with as much of your favorite things as you could ever want.Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.32,0:47:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,And that was the tenth time you called me by my name!Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is this what engagement is like?Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It is nyot! And why do you keep moving backwards?Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.70,0:47:43.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock, you can't spoil him like that.Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.91,0:47:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not allow any of the women to set foot on this island while Luffy-kun is training.Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to decide such things, Rayleigh?!Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.08,0:47:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer carefully. I might have to petrify you!Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.45,0:48:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],He can find all the food he needs in the mountains, forests, rivers or ocean!Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.93,0:48:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let go of his nose, Snyake Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.78,0:48:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,If he can't handle basic survival skills, he'll never make it as a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.37,0:48:13.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is all to help Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.34,0:48:18.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say... it's for Luffy's sake?Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.35,0:48:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I did.Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.51,0:48:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,For Luffy's sake...Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.96,0:48:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I shall endure it!Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.88,0:48:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,But Rayleigh, this island is truly dangerous.Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.62,0:48:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to him...Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.19,0:48:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The training would be pointless if nothing ever happened.Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.00,0:48:37.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're worried, then pray for his safety.Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.43,0:48:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright... Now we are the only two humans on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.83,0:48:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Look carefully at this vast wilderness. It is said that a country used to be here. Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.96,0:48:55.41,Main,,0,0,0,,But conditions were too harsh for humans to survive.Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.41,0:48:58.55,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],It's a harsh wilderness, a place where only the strong survive.Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.93,0:49:10.73,Main,,0,0,0,,This place smells of adventure!Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.77,0:49:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The island is crawling with beasts.Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.38,0:49:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot even count them all.Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.21,0:49:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],In your current state, there are at least five hundred that you can't beat.Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.86,0:49:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],You need to become stronger or you won't be able to sleep at night.Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,How can you tell what's here, or how many there are?Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.25,0:49:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],It's not just me. You, too, will learn to use this power.Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.38,0:49:43.23,Main,,0,0,0,,The power known as haki!Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.03,0:49:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! Look! Something's coming, Pops Rayleigh! Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.93,0:49:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops! Look behind you!Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.38,0:50:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Luffy. Haki is a power that dwells within everyone in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.44,0:50:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,An elephant?! It's five times as big as a normal one!Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.23,0:50:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's one amazing elephant!Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Presence. Fighting spirit. Control.Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.25,0:50:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It is no different from the other senses that normal humans have.Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.33,0:50:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But average humans don't even notice this power,Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.92,0:50:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],or they may try to develop it their entire lives without success.Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.40,0:50:29.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Removing all doubt. That is strength.Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.88,0:50:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Look out!Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.25,0:50:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Second. Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.98,0:50:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,[Attack],Jet Pistol.Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.82,0:50:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],Dammit, what's with this elephant? Not only is he strong, but he's fast too!Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.56,0:50:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch closely.Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.47,0:51:00.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Haki is typically divided into two shades.Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.86,0:51:03.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Look out!Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.10,0:51:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's alright.Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.17,0:51:08.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The elephant is swinging its trunk at me from the right.Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.52,0:51:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The power to be sensitive to your opponent's presence.Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.60,0:51:19.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the observation haki.Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.34,0:51:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing.Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.29,0:51:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can master this power,Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.88,0:51:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to discern both the location and number of enemies outside of your field of vision.Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.63,0:51:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It even allows you to predict what the enemy will do in the next moment.Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.74,0:51:36.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A kick with the left foot.Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.14,0:51:38.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mantra.Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.95,0:51:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,On the sky island of Skypiea they call this power "mantra".Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.45,0:51:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.60,0:51:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Next up, the armament haki.Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.96,0:51:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This one is like putting on invisible armor.Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.96,0:52:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.80,0:52:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I... know that one!Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.04,0:52:17.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,[Attack],Ashigara Dokkoi!Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.28,0:52:25.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger armor will obviously increase your attack power as well.Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.59,0:52:32.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurt! I'm made of rubber, yet that flick really hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.29,0:52:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the most useful part of this power.Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.70,0:52:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],When fighting against devil fruit users, the armament haki is the only way to oppose them.Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.12,0:52:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you must find a weakness in their individual powers.Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.28,0:52:55.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Even the freely flowing bodies of logia-users, which might otherwise seem invulnerable,Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.14,0:52:57.99,Main,,0,0,0,,can be struck normally by using it.Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.65,0:53:01.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Was this why you could touch Kizaru?Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:06.93,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],So that means I could even hit Smokey or Aokiji from the Navy by using this?Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.30,0:53:14.95,Main,,0,0,0,,This power can be imbued into weapons too.Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.95,0:53:17.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the archery of the Kuja Tribe?Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.14,0:53:18.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.24,0:53:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought they were steel arrows or something.Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.45,0:53:27.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The observation haki, and the armament haki.Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.45,0:53:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,These two types are haki.Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.03,0:53:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,However, a select few people in the world can utilize another kind of haki.Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.48,0:53:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.93,0:54:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the power to control your opponent,Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.96,0:54:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,the conqueror's haki.Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.90,0:54:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Many people who have made a name for themselves in this world...Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.37,0:54:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,possess this power hidden within them.Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.36,0:54:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,However, while the conqueror's haki can be controlled, it cannot be trained.Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.75,0:54:30.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It is the very spirit of the user.Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.13,0:54:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],The only way to strengthen it is to strengthen one's own mental strength.Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.75,0:54:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what you used back at the auction house!Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.86,0:54:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've experienced it already.Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.62,0:54:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Your potential as a conqueror is already awakening.Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.60,0:54:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,But you should refrain from using it until you've got it completely under control.Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.94,0:54:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll end up affecting innocent bystanders around you.Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.74,0:55:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.68,0:55:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.68,0:55:12.12,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],The crew of the pirate king can beat monsters like these without even touching them?Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.52,0:55:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you gained some respect for me?Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.73,0:55:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.20,0:55:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But I've seen this haki-thing several times before.Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.72,0:55:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Shanks... Grandpa...Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.56,0:55:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Enel and Aisa...Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.03,0:55:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,and then there's Hancock and the Kuja warriors.Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.37,0:55:37.85,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I'm sure you have. However, learning how to use haki will not be easy.Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.82,0:55:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.96,0:55:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Usually, the amount of time we have wouldn't be enough,Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.16,0:55:51.89,Main,,0,0,0,,but you have a lot of potential.Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.75,0:55:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Over the next two years,Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.56,0:56:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],I intend to try to teach you the basics of the observation, armament and conqueror's haki.Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],However, most people tend to develop one specific type above the others, Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.18,0:56:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,depending on their own skills and weaknesses.Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.81,0:56:14.35,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],They single out the one they're best at, and concentrate on that one.Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.35,0:56:18.49,Main,,0,0,0,[Linebreaker Removed],If you strengthen your skills in all three, you'll be able to acheive much more.Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.49,0:56:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, I got it.Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.68,0:56:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then,Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.69,0:56:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't go easy on you, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.99,0:56:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Right! I don't want you to either!Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.67,0:56:34.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait a sec!Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.90,0:56:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops said this was the one safe spot, right?Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.85,0:56:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat Luffy is taking a short break.Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.78,0:57:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.48,0:57:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This too.Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.40,0:57:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys...Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:35.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.90,0:57:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.66,0:57:43.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We're starting!Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.02,0:57:45.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.85,0:57:56.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:57:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,No good.Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.80,0:58:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],Say "Please teach me, Rayleigh-san"!Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.40,0:58:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,[Honorifics],No, "Rayleigh-sensei"!Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Or "Master Rayleigh"?Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.94,0:58:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Please teach me, Rayleigh!Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.32,0:58:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter.Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.22,0:59:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Usopp, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.85,0:59:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, Chopper...Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.50,0:59:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, Franky, Brook...Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.05,0:59:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,And, Ace and Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.53,0:59:55.10,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to reaffirm my promise...Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.10,0:59:57.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I will become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:06.32,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:09.02,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing BastiaDialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:14.36,Credits,,0,0,0,,QC Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:16.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.50,Credits,,0,0,0,,Opening Raw GavynDialogue: 1,0:58:18.53,0:58:18.98,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:58:18.98,0:58:19.23,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.58,0:58:18.98,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:58:18.98,0:58:23.82,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.63,0:58:23.57,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 2,0:58:23.57,0:58:23.87,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.68,0:58:23.62,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 2,0:58:23.62,0:58:23.92,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 1,0:58:18.73,0:58:23.67,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 2,0:58:23.67,0:58:23.97,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 1,0:58:18.78,0:58:23.72,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 2,0:58:23.72,0:58:24.02,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 1,0:58:18.83,0:58:23.77,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialogue: 2,0:58:23.77,0:58:24.07,Translation We Are,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialo